WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:11.250
Read text around you with Seeing AI
The first Seeing AI channel is short text.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:15.919
And like the name suggests, we can use this
for reading text in our environment.

00:00:15.919 --> 00:00:19.960
You’d be surprised just how many things
have writing on.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:27.760
And Seeing AI can instantly read any, not
handwriting, but any standard text.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:33.530
The ability for computers to read text using
OCR has been around for many years.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:38.270
But what makes this unique is the way that
it starts reading straight away.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:40.690
A simple example hear.

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:44.280
I have two envelopes for me and a colleague.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:46.200
But I don’t know which is mine.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:54.540
So I’m just going to take one of these envelopes
and put it under the camera.

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.990
&gt; Anirudh Koul
Cool.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:01.790
So as you heard, it said Anirudh Koul, who
is my colleague.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:03.150
So that’s not my envelope.

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:08.619
So, just to make sure, let’s try the other
envelope.

00:01:08.619 --> 00:01:09.720
&gt; Saqib Shaikh.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:10.720
Cool.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:14.760
Bad pronunciation, but yes, that’s, that’s
mine.

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:16.520
Now that worked quite well.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:22.310
Sometimes, however, you may find that the
app doesn’t read all the text.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:26.300
That might be, because you’re off to the
side or a bit too close.

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:30.880
So you should try moving the phone around
until you get all the texting in view.

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:36.100
Also, this works best for short amounts of
answer text, where it can all be in view at

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:37.280
once.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:43.700
If you want to read a whole document, then
we have a different channel for that.

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:48.050
And talking of documents, I wonder what’s
inside the envelope.

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:49.890
Microsoft logo appears.

